  "description": "The Rodian prisoner gets a head start, but Boba Fett soon finds a black melon of his own. While the Tusken rests, the prisoners continue the search and unfortunately for him, the Rodian unearths a Tatooine sand ape. Tearing itself up from the sandy ground, the behemoth first crushes its Rodian discoverer, brutally smashing the alien being into the dune. Next, the sand ape thwarts an attack by the Tusken's massiff, which is beaten and thrown out into the distance."
